 "notes": [
  "Posted 14 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "The post has no starting section; the strategy says 'Start Shmi's Hut and HFTMF for Scrambled every time', so the starting cards are Tatooine: Slave Quarters (Shmi's Hut), Heading For The Medical Frigate and Scrambled Transmission. They are in the 60. Other possible starting Effects it names: Battle Plan, Don't Do That Again, Draw Their Fire, Ounee Ta, Your Insight Serves You Well.",
  "The description calls it 'My RamapoCon 3 winning light deck'; the strategy says it went 10-1 in sanctioned play and won the final of the open by 29, and that this is the exact version played in the open. The poster signs as RamapoCon 3 Champion and Massachusetts State Champion.",
  "Weapon Levitation dested the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt; Don't Do That Again is a 2001 Effect (Tatooine), counted in the 60.",
